# 🏢 Business Website (PHP)

A modern, responsive business website built with PHP, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.  
Includes multiple pages, admin-ready structure, and database integration.

---

## 🚀 Features
- Responsive modern UI
- Multi-page structure (Home, About, Services, Portfolio, Pricing, Contact)
- PHP backend integration
- Database support (MySQL / SQL file)
- Clean modular code structure
- Easy deployment on any server

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- PHP
- MySQL

---

## 📁 Project Structure
- `assets/` → CSS, JS, images
- `includes/` → reusable components
- `config/` → database config
- `admin/` → admin panel (if used)
- `database.sql` → database schema
- `index.php` → main entry file

---

## ⚙️ Installation

1. Clone repository
2. Import `database.sql` into MySQL
3. Configure database in `config/`
4. Run project on local server (XAMPP / LAMP / Termux)

